          "_name": "acontact1",
          "_sourceTheme": "calmm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"contact1 calmm5\" group=\"Contact\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\" checked>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"List\" name=\"showList\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"List Count\" name=\"listCount\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"showList\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container-small': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"item-img\">\n                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/c4fd89e6-8f91-4ab6-a6c1-215eafb65403-1160x2062.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showList || showText || showButtons\">\n                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                    <b>\n                        Inputs and Outputs: Reflections</b></h5>\n                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Coding is completely new to me but I tried to familiarise myself with it before I arrived in Barcelona. I understood the logic behind it but I was not confident enough to apply it to things that I designed. <br><br>The pre-course helped to give a good understanding of the basics of code and how to use Arduino. I look forward to exploring more about this in the master's. <br>The circuits were easy to comprehend after they explained it to us and it made me want to use more of this as it would improve the scope with which I design. Josep and Adai were very helpful and showed me patiently until I learned about the Arduino that we were using (Barduino).</p>\n                <div class=\"list-box\" mbr-if=\"showList\">\n                    <div class=\"list-item\">\n                        <p class=\"list-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".list-text\">\n                            <b>calmm5.@support.com</b>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-item\" mbr-if=\"listCount > 1\">\n                        <p class=\"list-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".list-text\">\n                            <b>+22 3456 533 942</b>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-item\" mbr-if=\"listCount > 2\">\n                        <p class=\"list-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".list-text\">\n                            <b>calmm5.@support.com</b>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-item\" mbr-if=\"listCount > 3\">\n                        <p class=\"list-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".list-text\">\n                            <b> +22 3456 533 942</b>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                    <a href class=\"btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        GET STARTED\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tYJDNfI7TT",
          "_anchor": "acontact1-2y",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
