        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "& when (@reverseContent)": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".col-title": {
              "padding-top": "5.5%",
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding-top": "0"
              }
            },
            ".col-text": {
              "padding-top": "100px",
              "@media (min-width: 1200px)": {
                "& when not (@reverseContent)": {
                  "padding-left": "110px !important"
                },
                "& when (@reverseContent)": {
                  "padding-right": "110px !important"
                }
              },
              "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                "padding-top": "70px"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding-top": "20px"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "color": "#131313"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "margin-top": "24px",
              "color": "#131313",
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "margin-top": "16px"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#131313"
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn": {
              "margin-top": "50px",
              "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                "margin-top": "14px"
              },
              ".btn-white": {
                "&:hover": {
                  "color": "@primaryColor !important"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "aheader3",
          "_sourceTheme": "calmm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header3 calmm5\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#a6d8b5\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#a6d8b5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.1\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-title col-12 col-lg-6 flex-grow-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n                    <b>Digital Fabrication: Reflections</b></h1>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">\n                    <b>Premium digital solutions tailored to your needs</b>\n                </h2>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-text col-12 col-lg-6 flex-grow-1\" mbr-if=\"showText || showButtons\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>3D Printing<br></b><br><b>Reflections on the Class<br></b><br>- The feeling of bringing your ideas to life is beyond cool.<br>- It's all about trial and error – you'll mess up, but that's how you learn.<br>- Be patient, embrace the learning curve, and you'll be 3D printing like a pro in no time.<br><br><b>Laser Cutting<br></b><br><b>Reflections about the Class<br></b><br>- The class was an eye-opener about the versatility and precision of laser cutting technology.<br>- I was amazed by the variety of materials that can be used, from wood to acrylic to metal and even textiles.<br>- Learning about vector and raster graphics was key to understanding how to create designs that translate well to laser cutting.<br>- I can't wait to experiment and create my own laser-cut designs – the possibilities seem endless!<br><br><b>CNC</b><br><br><b>Reflections about the Class<br></b><br>- The control and precision you have over materials are nuts.<br>- Learning about G-code and toolpath strategies is something I need to do<br>- Material selection is crucial; it can make or break your project.<br>- The class made me appreciate the craftsmanship behind CNC machining and its role in modern manufacturing.<br><br>In the class, we also looked at all the machines and formed small groups to ideate on the types of things we can do with these machines and a simple tilt sensor.</p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"digitalfabricationnotes.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">\n                        <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-right mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>\n                        Read Class Notes</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tUTFVCGePO",
          "_anchor": "aheader3-2s",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
    },
