als: Update</a><div class=\"dropdown\"><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black dropdown-toggle\" href=\"term3.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Future Talks</a><div class=\"dropdown-menu dropdown-submenu\" aria-labelledby=\"dropdown-527\"><a class=\"show dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"saulbaeza.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Saul Baeza</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black\" href=\"term3.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">New Item</a></div></div><div class=\"dropdown\"><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black dropdown-toggle\" href=\"term3.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Digital Prototyping for Design</a><div class=\"dropdown-menu dropdown-submenu\" aria-labelledby=\"dropdown-101\"><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black show text-primary\" href=\"velostatsensor.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">4: Body and Sensors</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black show text-primary\" href=\"wekinator.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">5: AI and Visuals</a></div></div><div class=\"dropdown\"><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black dropdown-toggle\" href=\"term3.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Microchallenge</a><div class=\"dropdown-menu dropdown-submenu\" aria-labelledby=\"dropdown-544\"><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black show text-primary\" href=\"microchallenge3.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">3</a></div></div><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"communicatingideas3.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Communicating Ideas</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"communicatingideas3.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Design Ethics</a><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"communicatingideas3.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Critical Transfeminist Design<br></a></div></div><a class=\"show dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"https://seenunseen.mobirisesite.com\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">End of Year Project<br></a></div>\n                    </li><li class=\"nav-item dropdown\"><a class=\"nav-link link text-black dropdown-toggle show\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\">MDEF02</a><div class=\"dropdown-menu show\" aria-labelledby=\"dropdown-186\" data-bs-popper=\"none\"><a class=\"text-black show dropdown-item text-primary\" href=\"businessinnovation.html#aheader3-ad\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Business Innovation<br></a><a class=\"text-black show dropdown-item text-primary\" href=\"page64.html#aheader2-ak\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">LLUM</a></div></li><li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link link text-black show text-primary\" href=\"mastersproject.html#top\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Masters Project</a></li></ul>\n                <div mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"navbar-buttons mbr-section-btn\"><a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"mdefmenu.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">MDEF</a></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-item\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n</section>",
