aceholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Fair Futures</a><a class=\"show dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"measuringtheworld.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Measuring the World</a><a class=\"show dropdown-item text-black\" href=\"extendedintelligences2.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Extended Intelligences</a><a class=\"show dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"communicatingideas.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Communicating Ideas<br></a><div class=\"dropdown\"><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary dropdown-toggle\" href=\"digitalprototypingfordesign.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Digital Prototyping for Design</a><div class=\"dropdown-menu dropdown-submenu\" aria-labelledby=\"dropdown-475\"><a class=\"show dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"biomaterials.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">1: Biomaterials</a><a class=\"show dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"growingmaterials.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">2: Growing and Extruding</a><a class=\"show dropdown-item text-black text-primary\" href=\"cncdpd.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">3: CNC</a></div></div><div class=\"dropdown\"><a class=\"dropdown-item text-black text-primary dropdown-toggle\" href=\"communicatingideas.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\" data-to