        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "& when (@reverseContent)": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".col-title": {
              "padding-top": "5.5%",
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding-top": "0"
              }
            },
            ".col-text": {
              "padding-top": "100px",
              "@media (min-width: 1200px)": {
                "& when not (@reverseContent)": {
                  "padding-left": "110px !important"
                },
                "& when (@reverseContent)": {
                  "padding-right": "110px !important"
                }
              },
              "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                "padding-top": "70px"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding-top": "20px"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "color": "#131313"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "margin-top": "24px",
              "color": "#131313",
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "margin-top": "16px"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#131313"
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn": {
              "margin-top": "50px",
              "@media (max-width: 1199px)": {
                "margin-top": "14px"
              },
              ".btn-white": {
                "&:hover": {
                  "color": "@primaryColor !important"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "aheader3",
          "_sourceTheme": "calmm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header3 calmm5\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#de446f\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#a6d8b5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.1\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-title col-12 col-lg-6 flex-grow-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n                    <b>Measuring the World</b></h1>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">\n                    <b>Premium digital solutions tailored to your needs</b>\n                </h2>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-text col-12 col-lg-6 flex-grow-1\" mbr-if=\"showText || showButtons\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b><i>\n                    Reflection</i></b><br><br>This week was very intriguing as i was able to explore arduino, scrapping and data collection in a new way that i have never had access to before due to not being able to code or knowing anything about it. thanks to my teammates, i was able to get clarity on the frameworks and structures. <br><br>i enjoyed walking around the city and collecting data from different points. it made me think of how many lenses we can observe the city through and how much access we have to open data in barcelona <br><br>an especially new concept to me since in india all the data is outdated and there are too many people to keep it updated accurately and parties in power can manipulate data for their own advancement.<br><br>below, you can find the link to the hackmd document of our project</p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-info\" href=\"https://hackmd.io/@usaestoparadescargar/ryR2UAlsp\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">\n                        <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-right mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>\n                        CONNECT WITH OTHERS</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "u8KjXdH3Q0",
          "_anchor": "aheader3-87",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "microchallenges.html": {
